 current shard.\n\n## Boundaries\n- No external VLM call was made.\n- No Supabase mutation, storage upload, HTTP write probe, UI change, rights approval, display eligibility, receipt approval, Method Map truth, or scoring claim is introduced.\n\nCloses #1194\n\n## Verification\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-vlm-authorization-harness.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-vlm-candidate-packet.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/source-figure-asset-candidates.test.js` — 3 suites, 22 tests passed.\n- `env -u AO_EXTERNAL_VLM_AUTHORIZED -u AO_EXTERNAL_VLM_SCOPE -u FIGUREASSET_VLM_AUTHORIZED -u FIGUREASSET_VLM_SCOPE node scripts/method-map/run-figureasset-vlm-authorization-harness.mjs --generated-at 2026-07-03T00:00:00.000Z --check` — pass, artifacts match generated output.\n- `npm run lint:changed` — pass.\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/run-figureasset-vlm-authorization-harness.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-vlm-authorization-harness.test.js` — pass.\n- `node scripts/phase2/scan_security_redaction.js` — issue_count 0.\n- Targeted no-secret artifact value scan — forbidden_value_hit_count 0.\n- `npm run quality:w9:supply-chain-secret` — pass; generated W9 evidence churn was not included in this PR.\n- `git diff --check` — pass.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — top_status warning only for branch ownership; worktree clean, upstream synced, artifact guard healthy, A+ ratchet healthy.\n","created_at":"2026-07-03T11:27:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T11:30:03Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T11:29:49Z","merged_at":"2026-07-03T11:29:49Z","merge_commit_sha":"31dde5f2f46edcb787c4a12b4c2851393dffe191","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1228/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-h